    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.11_base_commutative_diagram.chapters.23_summary_audit_residual.sections.01_summary_textbook_chapter.concrete_anchor_9_microchipidentifies#microchip_identifies" .
silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_23_summary_audit_residual_sections_01_summary_textbook_chapter_concrete_anchor_9_microchipidentifies#microchip_identifies silm:hasLongDescription "The microchip_identifies is the microchip-reader typed arrow identifying Mittens by id, NOT replacing the apex. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'microchip_identifies', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
